态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "source_type": "repost_fallback", "source_comment_id": "comment_073", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_095", "text": "这价格都够我买辆二手奥拓了，但人家卖的是品牌和设计，咱们这些打工人只能看看热闹。不过话说回来，儿童车安全第一，希望厂家别光顾着赚钱，忘了质量。", "profile_id": 4, "profile_label": "玩世不恭的段子手", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "吃瓜派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "neutral", "source_type": "repost_fallback", "source_comment_id": "comment_063", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_096", "text": "儿童市场越来越高端化，反映了消费主义对社会的影响，我们是否应该反思这种过度营销？", "profile_id": 9, "profile_label": "忧国忧民的沉思者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "questioning", "source_type": "repost_fallback", "source_comment_id": "comment_037", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_097", "text": "15800元的儿童车，华为和赛力斯这是要收割中产家庭吗？说是联合设计，其实就是贴牌卖情怀，这种营销套路见多了，最终买单的还是普通消费者。", "profile_id": 1, "profile_label": "愤世嫉俗的批判者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "source_type": "repost_fallback", "source_comment_id": "comment_050", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_098", "text": "赛力斯和华为联手，连儿童车都要割韭菜？15800元买个玩具，真是贫穷限制了我的想象。", "profile_id": 1, "profile_label": "愤世嫉俗的批判者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "source_type": "repost_fallback", "source_comment_id": "comment_021", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_099", "text": "想起小时候的玩具车，都是几十块钱的，现在孩子真幸福，有这种高级玩具。虽然买不起，但看看也挺开心，希望有更多家庭能负担得起。", "profile_id": 3, "profile_label": "共情共鸣的叙事者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "positive", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "support", "source_type": "repost_fallback", "source_comment_id": "comment_043", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_100", "text": "华为和赛力斯联合设计儿童车？还1:1复刻M9？15800元买个玩具？这价格都够买辆真·电动车了，怕是收割智商税吧。", "profile_id": 1, "profile_label": "愤世嫉俗的批判者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "source_type": "repost_fallback", "source_comment_id": "comment_041", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}]}
